{"id":"word:hebrew:H6035","type":"word","title":"עָנָו","subtitle":"H6035 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"depressed (figuratively), in mind ( gentle ) or circumstances ( needy , especially saintly )","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to עָנָו (H6035) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-m.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 26 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"עָנָו (ʻânâv) means depressed (figuratively), in mind ( gentle ) or circumstances ( needy , especially saintly ) First listed occurrence: Amos 2 7."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"עָנָו","transliteration":"ʻânâv","pronunciation":"aw-nawv'","strong":"H6035","lemmaId":"hebrew:H6035","partOfSpeech":"n-m","forms":["עֲנָוִ֣ים","ענוים","עֲנָוִֽים","עֲנָוִ֖ים","ענוי"],"morphs":[["HAampa",17],["HAampc",4],["HAamsa",2],["HR/Aampc",1],["HC/R/Aampa",1],["HC/Aampa",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"depressed (figuratively), in mind ( gentle ) or circumstances ( needy , especially saintly )","usage":"humble, lowly, meek, poor. Compare 6041 .","full":"H6035. anav עָנָי (?; Lag BN 48 ) noun masculine poor, afflicted, humble, meek ; — עָנָו Num 12:3 (Kt; Qr עָנָיו is to ensure the ָ֯ according to Di Kö ii. 1. 76 ); elsewhere plural עֲנָוִים Isa 29:19 11 t. + Kt עֲנָוִים 32:7 ; Psa 9:19 (Qr עֲנִיִּים ); Qr עֲנָוִים 9:13 ; 10:12 ; Prov 3:34 ; 14:21 ; 16:19 (Kt עניים ); construct עַנְוֵי Zeph 2:3 2 t., + Kt ענוי (Qr עֲנִיֵּי ) Amos 8:4 (so Job 24:4 van d. H.; but עֲנִיֵּי Kt and Qr Baer Ginsb) — these forms shew confusion with עָנִי , which is perhaps only another form of עָנָו (otherwise Rahlfs op. cit. 62 f. Dr 'Poor' in Hastings DB ; עָנָו = humble, meek , עָנִי = passive humbled, afflicted); — 1 poor, needy , Prov 14:21 (Qr). 2 poor and weak. oppressed by rich and powerful Amos 2:7 ; Isa 29:19 ; 32:7 (Kt); (ה)ארץ ענוי Psa 76:10 ; Isa 11:4 ; Zeph 2:3 ; Amos 8:4 (Kt), Job 24:4 . 3 poor, weak and afflicted Israel (usually rendered meek ) Psa 10:17 ; 22:27 ; 25:9 (twice in verse); 34:3 ; 37:11 ; 69:33 ( עָנִי 3 , also in all these Psalms), Psa 147:6 ; 149:4 ; Isa 61:1 (|| לב נשׁברי , compare 66:2 עָנִי 3 ), Psa 9:19 (Kt) 9:13 ; 10:12 (Qr). 4 humble, lowly, meek Num 12:3 (Moses); Prov 3:34 ; 16:19 (both Qr).","rootNote":"or (by intermixture with 6041 ) עָנָיו ; from 6031 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"Amos 2 7","keyReferences":["Amos 2 7","Amos 8 4","Isa 11 4","Isa 29 19","Isa 32 7","Isa 61 1","Job 24 4","Num 12 3"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":26,"occurrences":[{"reference":"Amos 2 7","book":"Amos","chapter":2,"verse":7,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עֲנָוִ֖ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HAampa"},{"reference":"Amos 8 4","book":"Amos","chapter":8,"verse":4,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"ענוי","source":"hebrew","morph":"HAampc"},{"reference":"Isa 11 4","book":"Isa","chapter":11,"verse":4,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לְ/עַנְוֵי","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Aampc"},{"reference":"Isa 29 19","book":"Isa","chapter":29,"verse":19,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עֲנָוִ֛ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HAampa"},{"reference":"Isa 32 7","book":"Isa","chapter":32,"verse":7,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"ענוים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HAampa"},{"reference":"Isa 61 1","book":"Isa","chapter":61,"verse":1,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עֲנָוִ֗ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HAampa"},{"reference":"Job 24 4","book":"Job","chapter":24,"verse":4,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עֲנִיֵּי","source":"hebrew","morph":"HAampc"},{"reference":"Num 12 3","book":"Num","chapter":12,"verse":3,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"ענו","source":"hebrew","morph":"HAamsa"},{"reference":"Num 12 3","book":"Num","chapter":12,"verse":3,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עָנָ֣יו","source":"hebrew","morph":"HAamsa"},{"reference":"Prov 3 34","book":"Prov","chapter":3,"verse":34,"englishText":"","sourceWor